# `use` extends dep's class P. Making P final changes only P's own modifiers, not any member, so
# the change must reach the API hash through the class header for `use` to be recompiled.
> use/compile
$ sleep 2000
$ copy-file changes/P.scala dep/src/main/scala/P.scala
-> use/compile
> use/clean
> dep/clean
-> use/compile
